  "description": "YIGLAC crystallizes in the tetragonal crystal system with space group P -4 21 c. Reported CIF formula moiety: C60 H132 Lu4 O12,C6 H14. From the CIF bond table, Lu1 (Lu) has 5 O neighbors; Lu1C (Lu) has 5 O neighbors; Lu1A (Lu) has 5 O neighbors; Lu1B (Lu) has 5 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 4 pairs, 1 components; largest component is a network with cycles with approximately planar metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.463-3.463 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 102.60-103.63°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula C60H132Lu4O12·C6H14.",
